@Node coder "(-     gONZALEZ      -)"

 Yes, here I am. I checked this Util on a A4000/40 /X 3.37 and
 A4000/30 S-Express Board and never found any bug.
 But if you find one or think this tool could be made
 better so just contact me (Gonzalez) or any other Motion Member.



                           @{" Back to main menu " link "MAIN"}
@endnode
@Node Intro "(-     Features      -)"

 I thought that standart "2" command is not very comfortable
 so that i decided to code a  Callerslog Reader which is
 easier to look for the last callers. 
 in your filelist.
 
 * no Backdoors
  
  


                           @{" Back to main menu " link "MAIN"}
@endnode
@Node Install "(-   Installation    -)"


  /X2.x: Append the following Line to your
         BBS:Commands/BBS.CMD File:
         ---------------------->> Cut Here <<--------------------------
         log          RM200DOORS:rEALOG/rEALOG.rexx
         ---------------------->> Cut Here <<--------------------------

  /X3.x: 1) Copy LOG.INFO to your BBS:Syscmd-Drawer
         2) Copy REALOG-Drawer to your Doors:

  *** Complete ***

                         @{" Back to main menu " link "MAIN"}
@endnode
@Node Instr "(- Instruction -)"
         

         REALOG.CONFIG:
	 ---------------------->> Cut Here <<--------------------------
         lines 10
         path bbs:node%
         ---------------------->> Cut Here <<--------------------------    

         The number of lines is the number of Lines that is shown in the
         logfilemenu.
         In the 2nd Line you have to put your Path to the callerslog.

         *** That's all ***


                           @{" Back to main menu " link "MAIN"}
@endnode

